      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Distributed Lock Service (Chubby / ZooKeeper)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Build the small, boring, super-reliable service that lets thousands of machines agree on \"who is in charge\" and \"who may touch this right now\". You will learn sessions, leases, consensus-backed state, watches and the one idea interviewers always probe: the fencing token.</p>\n      "
